{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/397623-abyssal-working-for-non-deathlords","id":397623,"title":"Abyssal working for non-Deathlords ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-08T09:06:35-08:00","id":397623,"title":"Abyssal working for non-Deathlords ?","content":"<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ujZijnH.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> <br /> <br /> Since Abyssal won't be the Deathlord's lapdog-on-demand anymore, how does people feel about the Chosen of Oblivion working for non-Deathlord like demon, non-stabby Sidereal or Fair Folk ? The soul pantheon of Ebby would probably be delighted if I give them some Deathlords as plaything, ohhh, the happy look on Alveua's face as she hammer the Semen Lover into a toilet would be so worth it, and Raski will finally reveal whether she's playing with all the toddlers before she eat them if I can offer her ten-thousand dicks freshly cut from the Penis Bishop. The potential for plothook is endless !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 02-08-2015, 12:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T09:12:09-08:00","id":397650,"title":"","content":"I'd imagine that an Abyssal can work with anyone who is willing to overlook their creepy unsettling powers.<br /> <br /> Also, did you watch DBZ Kai on Toonami last night? Because it was airing the episode where Tien got his arm punched off in a manner similar to that picture.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T12:34:53-08:00","id":397895,"title":"","content":"Fuck yeah, Jen Thread. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T13:15:19-08:00","id":397958,"title":"","content":"If Sijan doesn't have at least one working for them, I'll be shocked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T13:55:52-08:00","id":397991,"title":"","content":"As always, the guild would be all too happy to employ an Exalt within their ranks, especially one that is familiar with the Underworld and can take on their inhabitants.<br /> <br /> Trouble is, there's always the slight risk that said Abyssal is a double agent for the Timeless Order. Who would almost certainly want a deathly exalt in their corner. Or at least not aimed at them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T14:44:11-08:00","id":398071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/397623-abyssal-working-for-non-deathlords?p=397991#post397991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As always, the guild would be all too happy to employ an Exalt within their ranks, especially one that is familiar with the Underworld and can take on their inhabitants.<br /> <br /> Trouble is, there's always the slight risk that said Abyssal is a double agent for the Timeless Order. Who would almost certainly want a deathly exalt in their corner. Or at least not aimed at them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hmmm didn't the Liminal in Masters of Jade specifically work for the Guild rooting out the ghosts who haunt their caravans? I could see how a Abyssal unaligned with the Deathlords could fill a similar role.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T18:50:14-08:00","id":398291,"title":"","content":"I think it's fine. The Cult of the Illuminated already have one in their book. They send him to do dodgy stuff like murder people, and Lytek supports them in return for being able to study the Abyssal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T18:58:54-08:00","id":398295,"title":"","content":"The Abyssals have never really been the Deathlord's lapdogs-on-demand. In fact, I seem to recall the developers being fairly open during both editions about the fact that the Deathlords are training their replacements and they don't even know it.<br /> <br /> So yeah, they can work for whoever they want. It should be even easier in 3e, since I seem to recall that Resonance is going to be a lot less punishing this time around.<br /> <br /> (I'm somewhat ambivalent about that. On the one hand, Abyssals should probably not be like Prometheans, where they can't ever rest in one place very long without tearing it down around them. On the other hand, the Neverborn probably would include <i>some</i> sort of mechanism by which they can be very, very sure that the Abyssals are always going to do their jobs, being as how the Neverborn went down the road of &quot;let's imbue some servitors with vast powers and only minimally functional leashes&quot; and the end result of that was &quot;said servitors murdered the fuck out of us and now we're the Neverborn.&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T19:24:41-08:00","id":398305,"title":"","content":"dang, that is a heck of a punch","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":""